WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:41.510
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:48.350
<i>Taichi and the Chosen Ones with their
partner Digimon continue their journey</i>

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:53.820
<i>to prevent the revival of the bringer
of destruction, Millenniumon.</i>

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:58.320
<i>And they head toward
the Sealed Grounds, FAGA.</i>

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.540
<i>The eight Chosen Ones
had finally come together.</i>

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.640
<i>At times, they dashed through sandstorms,</i>

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.000
<i>and other times, swam the ocean depths.</i>

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:15.090
<i>And now,
the place they had come upon was...</i>

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:18.130
Look, there!

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:21.140
Oh, good! It's still there.

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:23.640
The haven for the traveling Digimon.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:26.560
Like an oasis, huh?

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.480
Let's take a little break here.

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:33.770
Resting is important
to prepare yourself for battle.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:40.740
Well... I can sense quite a bit
of history.

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:44.120
It's not abandoned, right?

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.000
What's that?

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.960
I smell something yummy!

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.550
I want some!

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.420
Mimi, let's go look!

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:56.090
Yeah! I'm hungry!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.260
Be careful!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:01.100
Joe, let's go too!

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:04.410
Y-Yeah... Is it safe?

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:07.770
JYAGAMON, POTATO HELL

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.060
There seems to be no danger
at the moment.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.860
Where should we take Komondomon?

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.400
Whoa!

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.740
KUNEMON

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.790
FLORAMON

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:36.460
KAMEMON

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.840
There's a bunch of Digimon!

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:41.170
There don't seem to be scary ones here.

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.060
Everyone looks happy.

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.890
Oh! Aren't those...

00:03:44.890 --> 00:03:45.800
Mimi!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.980
They're hamburgers!

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:51.310
The tasty food that
you were talking about before, right?

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.650
Why is there our world's food here?

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:55.860
It's yummy!

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.070
Sora, have some too!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:59.400
What? Can we just eat them?

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.820
Sure!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:05.570
Take any you like! Burger! Burger!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:10.200
All handmade hamburgers!

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.380
They're all free?!

00:04:13.380 --> 00:04:14.800
You really sure?

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:15.960
Uh-huh!

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:17.840
Thank you! And you are?

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.970
BURGAMON

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.880
Burgamon!

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:21.840
TORIKARABALLMON

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.600
Whoa, it's good!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.400
Seriously, it's very tasty!

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.730
Tasty!

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:36.230
Who would've thought we'd be able
to eat a burger here?

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.940
You could sell this!

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:39.730
So good!

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.820
Who would've guessed
a place like this existed...

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:43.610
Hm?

00:04:44.030 --> 00:04:44.910
Oh!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:48.870
Isn't this like the highway service areas?

00:04:48.870 --> 00:04:50.120
It is?

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.640
You've never seen one?

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.580
My house usually travels by plane, so...

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:55.460
Really.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.370
Why?!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:04:59.550
Why aren't the fries being eaten?

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:00.550
I'm eating them.

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.970
No! The Digimon here!

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:08.160
No one's eating the fries at all!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:12.290
Hmm, maybe they're not popular
among Digimon?

00:05:12.290 --> 00:05:14.640
Since fries are hard to grab.

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:20.190
What are you talking about?!
What is a burger without fries?!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.570
How could you not eat the fries?

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:26.450
Not eating the fries?

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.740
That's absurd!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.580
Joe?

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:35.250
Tailmon, you've been here before?

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.330
Yes, although it's aged quite a bit now.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.170
At least it's still here
like this today...

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:43.260
What's this?!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.640
What is this?!

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.840
It's like a sandstorm!

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:54.310
What's wrong, Komondomon?

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.100
Are you itchy?

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.490
Komondomon's itchy from all the sand.

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:04.700
Since we've been running
through the fields and jungle.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:06.510
Of course you'll get dirty.

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.910
I wish we could wash
Komondomon somehow...

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.120
There's another Komondomon!

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:28.390
Looks like a friend
who was revived together.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:30.850
That Komondomon was washed.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.890
Washed by who?

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:36.270
Lop-ear Ripple!

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:40.020
Huh?!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:43.520
Wow, they get washed with bubbles?

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.530
Thank you for waiting.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.300
LUNAMON

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:50.780
I'm Lunamon.
I will make you sparkly clean.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.580
I'm okay!

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.780
Is that so?

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.120
Ah, so this is how they get washed.

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:02.040
Tankmon?!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:07.680
Jeez, what a big sleepyhead.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.550
There are Tankmon like this too?

00:07:10.010 --> 00:07:11.470
They're Mercenary Digimon.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:14.180
This is how they are
when they're not working.

00:07:17.810 --> 00:07:20.190
Yup, this is the stuff!

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:23.440
There's no way anyone could not eat this.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:29.570
Fries are the stars of fast food!

00:07:29.570 --> 00:07:31.280
It is?

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.070
Sometimes after cram school...

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.870
<i>I'd drop by the burger shop
without telling my parents.</i>

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.330
<i>And I'd pick at the fries that I bought</i>

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:42.210
<i>with the little allowance I had
one fry at a time.</i>

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:52.380
That was the only moment of peace
I was allowed in the entrance exam war.

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.390
The time between just me and the fries.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:58.140
Whoa!

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:02.940
Thank you!

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:04.520
Potato.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.280
POTAMON

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:09.420
Yum, potato!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.620
There you are, Potamon.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:12.950
Potamon?

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:18.560
Here you go! Eat them all!

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:20.290
What an appetite!

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.540
Bravo!

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.370
Yum!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.980
You! You like fries?!

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:29.800
Burp!

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:37.430
The only one
who eats fries here is Potamon.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.180
Nice!

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.190
I love fries too!

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.650
The crispy surface!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:50.090
The steaming-hot softness that spreads
in your mouth!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:52.110
It's absolutely brilliant!

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.070
Yeah!

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:55.700
Potato cheers!

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.420
I think they became friends.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:04.850
Potato buddies, so they're potato buds.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:09.340
Potato buds! Potato buds! Potato buds!

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:10.710
Gomamon, you too!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:15.390
You're right, it's good!

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:17.930
Alright!
Gomamon, you're a potato bud too!

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.640
Potato buds!

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:23.100
Potato buds! Potato buds!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:24.980
Potamon.

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:27.980
To be honest...

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.980
today's the last day we serve fries.

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.370
Discontinued?

00:09:36.370 --> 00:09:38.700
You mean you can't eat them anymore?

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.740
It was decided by everyone.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.880
Whoa, all at once!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:59.640
Uh, wait!

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:06.400
I guess Potamon wants to be alone.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.730
You care that much...

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:14.030
Potamon...

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:16.410
Taichi.

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.930
Oh, Hikari.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.530
Did something happen?

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:21.750
Yeah, kind of.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:22.780
Wait...

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:26.040
Why are you holding a broom?

00:10:26.540 --> 00:10:29.040
Lop-ear Ripple!

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:54.730
Potamon...

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.860
Cheer up.

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:01.240
Yeah.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:02.820
Here, fries!

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.330
Thanks.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.580
Is it good?

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:09.460
Yeah.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.480
There you go.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.340
A gloomy face doesn't suit a leader.

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.340
He's the leader?

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:16.340
Huh?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.970
Thanks, Gomamon.

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.390
You're right,
I can't be down in the dumps for...

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:27.120
Oh, Joe!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.220
He slipped!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.940
You just said I slipped up, didn't you?!

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.480
Wait, that didn't hurt.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.240
Is he all right?

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:39.150
Yes, Lunamon's bubbles are fluffy
and soft.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.240
Wow, how interesting!

00:11:41.820 --> 00:11:44.990
Finished... Finished...

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.420
No more.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.090
Potato.

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:02.340
Finished...

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:05.640
No!

00:12:14.230 --> 00:12:16.020
Something's coming this way!

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:17.900
This is...

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:20.650
An evolution?!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:32.620
Are those...

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:34.250
potatoes?!

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.340
Here they come!

00:12:52.980 --> 00:12:54.730
Komondomon, get back!

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:01.360
The potato exploded!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:08.120
Please stop! This is everyone's oasis!

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.030
Watch out!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:12.710
You guys get out of here!

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:13.960
Thank you!

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.500
PUSURIMON

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.470
Run, Garurumon!

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.260
Yeah!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:34.180
Agumon Evolution!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:36.230
Greymon!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:42.820
<i>Yamato, take everyone to a safe place
while you can!</i>

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:43.860
Alright!

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:55.580
BLIMPMON

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:58.040
We're gonna take off like this!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.290
Silver Blaze!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.340
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:10.620
Jeez, too many potatoes!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.720
Gomamon!

00:14:11.720 --> 00:14:13.890
Gomamon Evolution!

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:16.180
Ikkakumon!

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:18.560
I've got it!

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:19.690
JYAGAMON

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:21.020
That's Jyagamon,
an Ultimate Digimon!

00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.570
Whoa! Here they come again!

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:32.910
No, my fries!

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:37.500
Joe!

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.050
What?

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:49.300
Fries?

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:59.140
This burp!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:01.230
Joe, you okay?

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:02.400
That's Potamon.

00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:03.270
What?!

00:15:03.690 --> 00:15:04.860
There's no mistake!

00:15:04.860 --> 00:15:08.900
That Jyagamon is the Digimon
that evolved from Potamon!

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.530
Potamon? From earlier?

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:12.820
Yeah.

00:15:13.570 --> 00:15:15.790
My potato bud!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:19.370
But why did that Potamon evolve?

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:23.790
I can understand.

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:28.490
The sorrow of not being able
to eat those beloved fries

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:31.840
is what made Potamon that way.

00:15:33.850 --> 00:15:36.310
Everyone, please lend me a hand!

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.810
I want to save Jyagamon!

00:15:41.480 --> 00:15:42.520
Thank you!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.570
Jyagamon! It's me, your potato bud, Joe!

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.740
Remember when we ate fries together?

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:11.590
The potato ring was restored!

00:16:11.970 --> 00:16:15.600
The rotating force means
more attack and defense!

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:19.100
So if we carelessly attack,
we'll be the ones in danger.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:22.060
We gotta stop that ring first!

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.350
They're coming!

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:40.870
It slipped!

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:44.370
Huh?

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.540
<i>It won't explode? How come?</i>

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:54.610
I know, it's Lunamon's bubbles!

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:59.220
<i>I see, we may be able to neutralize
that potato ring with those bubbles!</i>

00:16:59.640 --> 00:17:03.520
If we could just blow the bubbles
off Komondomon onto them at once...

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:06.980
Mimi-kun, bring Komondomon here!

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:09.110
<i>Hm? Okay.</i>

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:10.400
Joe?

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:12.690
I have a plan.

00:17:13.150 --> 00:17:14.320
Ikkakumon!

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:22.200
Ikkakumon Super Evolution!

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:26.710
Zudomon!

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.090
Mimi-kun!

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:37.890
Here we are!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:39.720
So, what are we gonna do?

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:46.600
The shock waves made with my hammer!

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:48.480
That's right!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:51.360
Take Komondomon in front of Zudomon!

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:57.110
You sure this is okay?!

00:17:58.610 --> 00:17:59.780
Here I go!

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:10.920
You missed!

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:13.670
No!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.930
Yes!

00:18:22.390 --> 00:18:23.350
Yeah!

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:25.430
Good, they won't explode!

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:27.310
Hikari!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:30.980
Leader, Zudomon, use my powers!

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:37.900
Tailmon Super Evolution!

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.870
Angewomon!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:51.670
Holy Arrow!

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.380
Alright!

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:07.220
Now, put your heart into that hammer
and give it to Jyagamon.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:09.390
Zudomon!

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:19.070
<i>Jyagamon,
please return to your fries-loving self!</i>

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:21.140
Joe!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.950
Go!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.330
Jyagamon!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:49.100
Huh?

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.360
Jyagamon...

00:19:57.980 --> 00:19:59.570
Can you tell who I am?

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.790
You can! My potato bud!

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:10.160
We did it, Joe!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:14.920
Thank you, Angewomon.

00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:21.680
The Holy Digimon's powers not only raised
Zudomon's but Joe Senpai's powers too.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.260
Everyone's amazing!

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:26.350
It was good you slipped today, Joe Senpai!

00:20:26.350 --> 00:20:28.850
Good thing you slipped today, Senpai!

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:31.770
Jeez! No more saying "slip"!

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:35.320
So is it Senpai or Leader? Which is it?

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.520
He's our senpai and our leader.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:42.240
Good, it looks like they got
through it somehow.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:47.200
The more we look, the more potato we find.
We could make a ton of potato salad.

00:20:47.660 --> 00:20:48.410
Oh!

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:57.210
Lots of new potato dishes! Super popular!

00:20:57.670 --> 00:21:00.460
All thanks to Jyagamon's potatoes!

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.010
Isn't that great?

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:05.510
I hope you continue to treasure
the time you have with your fries.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:09.600
You're all sparkly clean now, Komondomon!

00:21:10.640 --> 00:21:13.520
Take these bubbles,
so you can wash up any time!

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.480
Thank you, Lunamon.

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:18.060
Alright, let's set out!

00:21:18.610 --> 00:21:21.820
See you again, potato bud!

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.040
<i>ima mazari atteku border</i>

00:21:30.950 --> 00:21:33.120
<i>The border has now begun to blend</i>

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:36.020
<i>"It's uncharted territory from here!"</i>

00:21:33.200 --> 00:21:35.870
<i>koko kara wa jinrui mitou desu!</i>

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:38.500
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:38.420
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:42.510
<i>All that you desire awaits you</i>

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:42.510
<i>nozomu kagiri no subete ga aru kara</i>

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.770
<i>owari nanka nai ze sou sa</i>

00:21:53.640 --> 00:21:55.860
<i>The end doesn't exist, that's right</i>

00:21:55.860 --> 00:21:58.580
<i>We're at our starting point right now</i>

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:58.440
<i>koko wa ima bokura no shuppatsuten</i>

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.150
<i>Blue skies, the ends of the ocean</i>

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:01.070
<i>aoi sora umi no hate</i>

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:04.760
<i>There's a tomorrow that no one knows about</i>

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:04.650
<i>dare mo shiranai asu wa aru kara</i>

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:06.740
<i>So keep on smiling</i>

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:06.650
<i>waratte iyou</i>

00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>We're past the point of stopping
In our daily lives</i>

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:10.620
<i>imasara tachidomarenu bokura no
nichijou jou</i>

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.200
<i>Bring on the unknown!</i>

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:12.120
<i>michi joutou!</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.600
<i>That day, I drew on the wall with you</i>

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:14.450
<i>ano hi kimi to kabe ni kaita</i>

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:17.230
<i>The incomplete, the imperfect</i>

00:22:14.620 --> 00:22:17.080
<i>mikansei wo fukanzen wo</i>

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:19.940
<i>"You can't go anywhere at this point"</i>

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:19.790
<i>imasara doko e mo ikenai ze tte</i>

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:22.650
<i>Oh, is that so?! Oh, is that so?!</i>

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:22.500
<i>aa sou kai nee! aa sou kai nee!</i>

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:28.590
<i>Then we don't want to become a grown-up</i>

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:28.590
<i>nara otona ni nanka natcha ikenai nee</i>

00:22:31.100 --> 00:22:32.810
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.060 --> 00:22:35.390
<i>Lopmon.</i>

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:38.730
<i>A mysterious Digimon
with an unknown nature.</i>

00:22:35.470 --> 00:22:38.020
LEVEL: ROOKIE

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:40.610
TYPE: BEAST

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:43.340
<i>Lopmon uses both ears
to generate a tiny tornado, Petit Twister!</i>

00:22:40.610 --> 00:22:43.190
SPECIAL MOVE: PETIT TWISTER
DOUBLE TYPHOON / BLAZING ICE

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.380
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.380 --> 00:22:47.220
<i>The mysterious Digimon, Lopmon.</i>

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>When I asked Patamon for information
on Lopmon since they look alike,</i>

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:54.990
<i>Patamon said, "I think the big ears
give Lopmon a stiff neck."</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:07.130
<i>Taichi and Sora's cooperative killer shot
strikes Toropiamon.</i>

00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:11.890
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Strike! The Killer Shot"</i>

00:23:11.890 --> 00:23:14.470
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
